  function sysClassifyRequirement(req){const role=sx(req?.semanticRole||req?.type).toUpperCase(),text=sx(req?.description||req?.goal||req?.title||req);if(/PLAYER|AGENCY/.test(role)||/(?:사용자|플레이어).{0,28}(?:선택|결정|행동|정한다)/u.test(text))return 'PLAYER_AGENCY';if(/NEGATIVE|FORBID|CONSTRAINT/.test(role)||/(?:금지(?:한다|됨|되어)|하지\s*않는다|하지\s*않아야|하지\s*말아야|추가하지\s*않|노출하지\s*않|등장시키지\s*않|확정하지\s*않|없어야\s*(?:한다|함)|막지\s*않아야)/u.test(text))return 'NEGATIVE_CONSTRAINT';if(/READER|UNDERSTAND|PERCEPTION/.test(role)||/(?:독자|플레이어|주인공).{0,24}(?:이해|체감|느끼|인식|알게|받아들)/u.test(text))return 'READER_UNDERSTANDING';if(/RELATION/.test(role)||/(?:관계|신뢰|호감|경계|인상|동맹|적대|친밀)/u.test(text))return 'RELATIONSHIP_STATE';if(/ITEM|INVENTORY/.test(role))return 'INVENTORY_STATE';if(/DIALOGUE|SPEECH/.test(role))return 'DIALOGUE';if(/WORLD|STATE/.test(role)||/(?:상태|위치|남아|사라|도착|퇴장|종료|완료|확보|소모)/u.test(text))return 'WORLD_STATE';return 'PHYSICAL_FACT'}
