  function sysAliasAffirmed(aliases,evidence){return sl(aliases).map(value=>sx(value)).filter(Boolean).some(alias=>sysEvidenceClauses(evidence).some(clause=>clause.includes(alias)&&!SYS_COMPLETION_NEG_RE.test(clause)))}
  function sysNegativeTarget(text){return sx(text).replace(/(?:하지\s*않는다|하지\s*않아야|하지\s*말아야|금지(?:한다|됨|되어)?|추가하지\s*않는다|노출하지\s*않는다|등장시키지\s*않는다|확정하지\s*않는다|없어야\s*(?:한다|함)?)/gu,'').trim()}
  function sysNegativeSatisfied(req,evidence){const text=sx(req?.description||req?.goal||req),aliases=sl(req?.aliases).map(value=>sx(value)).filter(Boolean);if(sysAliasAffirmed(aliases,evidence))return false;const target=sysNegativeTarget(text);for(const clause of sysEvidenceClauses(evidence)){const coverage=sysSemanticCoverage(target,clause);if(coverage.ok&&!SYS_COMPLETION_NEG_RE.test(clause))return false}return true}
