  function sysChronologyIssue(text,txn){const start=sclock(txn?.start?.day||0,txn?.start?.time),endDay=(txn?.endStatePatch?.worldDay??txn?.corridor?.endDay??txn?.start?.day??0),end=sclock(endDay,txn?.guards?.forbidTimeAfter||txn?.endStatePatch?.worldTime||txn?.start?.time),allowance=Math.max(1,end-start)+120;for(const leap of sysNarrativeLeaps(text)){if(leap.seconds>allowance&&!sysLeapAuthorized(leap,txn)&&!sysLeapIsRetrospectiveV13(text,leap))return `UNLICENSED_FORWARD_LEAP:${leap.seconds}`}return ''}

  function sysPhysicalState(sc){sc.runtime=sc.runtime||{};const p=sc.runtime.systemicPhysicalState||(sc.runtime.systemicPhysicalState={schema:'CORTEX_PHYSICAL_CAPABILITY_V2',alive:'ALIVE',consciousness:'AWAKE',mobility:'FREE',restrained:false,vision:'AVAILABLE',speech:'AVAILABLE',handUse:'AVAILABLE',conditions:[],updatedTurn:0});return p}
  function sysExtractPhysical(sc,text,turnNo=0){const p=sysPhysicalState(sc),t=sx(text),set=(k,v)=>{p[k]=v},positive=(re)=>{const m=re.exec(t);return Boolean(m&&!/(?:아니|않|못)/u.test(t.slice(m.index,m.index+m[0].length+42)))};if(/(?:사망했|죽었다|숨이\s*멎|목숨을\s*잃|생명이\s*끊)/u.test(t))set('alive','DEAD');if(/(?:의식을\s*잃|정신을\s*잃|기절|실신|의식이\s*끊|혼절)/u.test(t))set('consciousness','UNCONSCIOUS');if(/(?:잠들|잠에\s*들|수면에\s*빠)/u.test(t))set('consciousness','SLEEPING');if(/(?:의식을\s*되찾|정신을\s*차리|눈을\s*떴|깨어났|잠에서\s*깼)/u.test(t))set('consciousness','AWAKE');const immobile=positive(/(?:전신\s*마비|온몸(?:이|을)?\s*움직일\s*수\s*없|몸\s*전체가\s*움직이지|사지가\s*움직이지|움직일\s*수\s*없)/u),lowerBody=/(?:다리|하반신|허리\s*아래|아랫부분|하체)[^.!?。！？]{0,100}(?:움직일\s*수\s*없|감각(?:이|은|이)\s*돌아오지|기능(?:을|이)\s*잃|마비|힘이\s*들어오지)/u.test(t);if(lowerBody)set('mobility','LOWER_BODY_IMMOBILE');else if(immobile)set('mobility','IMMOBILE');else if(/(?:절뚝|비틀거리|부축|기어가|심한\s*통증|다리를\s*끌)/u.test(t))set('mobility','LIMITED');if(/(?:묶였|결박|구속|수갑|포박)/u.test(t))p.restrained=true;if(/(?:풀려났|결박을\s*풀|수갑을\s*풀|구속에서\s*벗)/u.test(t))p.restrained=false;if(/(?:시력을\s*잃|보이지\s*않)/u.test(t))p.vision='LOST';if(/(?:시야가\s*돌아|다시\s*보이)/u.test(t))p.vision='AVAILABLE';if(/(?:말할\s*수\s*없|목소리가\s*나오지)/u.test(t))p.speech='LOST';if(/(?:다시\s*말할\s*수|목소리가\s*돌아)/u.test(t))p.speech='AVAILABLE';if(/(?:손을\s*쓸\s*수\s*없|손가락을\s*움직일\s*수\s*없)/u.test(t))p.handUse='LOST';if(/(?:손을\s*다시\s*움직|손가락에\s*감각이\s*돌아)/u.test(t))p.handUse='AVAILABLE';p.updatedTurn=turnNo;return p}
  function sysFrameCapabilityIssue(frame,p){if(!frame||frame.modality==='NEGATED')return '';const pred=sx(frame.predicate),motionText=sx(frame.raw||pred);if(frame.kind==='GENERIC_ACTION'&&/(?:기절|실신|끊겼|끊어진|정신을\s*잃)/u.test(pred))return '';if(p.alive==='DEAD'&&!['WAIT','REST'].includes(frame.kind))return 'DEAD_VOLUNTARY_ACTION';if(['UNCONSCIOUS','SLEEPING'].includes(p.consciousness)&&!['WAIT','REST'].includes(frame.kind))return 'UNCONSCIOUS_VOLUNTARY_ACTION';if(frame.kind==='MOVE'&&p.restrained)return 'RESTRAINED_MOVEMENT';if(frame.kind==='MOVE'&&p.mobility==='IMMOBILE')return 'IMMOBILE_MOVEMENT';if(frame.kind==='MOVE'&&p.mobility==='LOWER_BODY_IMMOBILE'&&!/(?:기어|끌고|몸을\s*끌|구르)/u.test(motionText))return 'LOWER_BODY_MOVEMENT_UNAVAILABLE';if(['ATTACK','ACQUIRE','STORE','RELEASE','OPEN','CLOSE','CREATE'].includes(frame.kind)&&p.handUse==='LOST')return 'HAND_USE_UNAVAILABLE';if(frame.kind==='COMMUNICATE'&&p.speech==='LOST')return 'SPEECH_UNAVAILABLE';return ''}
  function sysStateIssue(text,txn,sc){
